(suborbital-ballistic-tumble-return)
*title Synthetic suborbital launch and averaged tumbling atmospheric return
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0

*trajectory 1 tumbling-body start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=1 long=0 lat=0 vel=3000 gama=60 psi=90 time=0 mass=100
  *file suborbital-return.dat time alt vel gama dynprs cd
  *segment 1 ascent-and-return
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *aero cd=(cone-cd)
    *fly alpha=0
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
